// Every text the device display shows, one row per text:
// TEXT(KEY, "English", "Deutsch"), used as fg::tr(Text::KEY).
// A row needs one column per language in fg::Lang, so adding a language makes
// every row that misses it a compile error. Umlauts are the L_* macros from lang.h.
// Limits: 18 characters for a menu entry, 17 for a selection option, 21 per
// line and 4 lines elsewhere; printf placeholders in the same order in every column.

// Display widgets
TEXT(HOLD_FOR_OPTIONS,         "(hold for options)",          "(halten: Optionen)")
